## The Features

  # MegaBookx 
    - Social Platform - Like Facebook just better and not as adverting intrusive - The user is not the commodity
    - Allow for a virtual showroom where space is rented to users to showcase products - Cost works on an hourly, dayly, monthly rates
    - Allow for a waiting list to access the virtual show room.

  # MegaMall 
    - A virtual shopping mall where users rent shop space and present their goods.

  # MegaListing
    - This is a compact business listing where all businesses are listed and are easily found when users are looking for a particular business.
    - Must be geolocation sensitive
    - Each business, when listing gets a Micro-Website - Explained in document 12-MicroSites
    - Keywords driven
    - Allow for advertising space

